---
// Ubiquiti UniFi showcase — screenshots of real managed installs.
---

<section class="section networks" id="networks">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-head">
      <span class="eyebrow">Whole Home & Office Networking</span>
      <h2 class="section-title">Ubiquiti UniFi, installed &amp; managed end to end</h2>
      <p class="section-lead">
        I design, install, and manage Ubiquiti UniFi networks -- from the gateway at your point of
        entry, to every access point on the premises. One controller for all of it: Wi-Fi, wired
        backbone, cameras, and doorbells.
      </p>
    </div>

    <figure class="shot">
      <img
        src="/images/ubiquiti-site-manager.png"
        width="2101"
        height="563"
        loading="lazy"
        alt="Ubiquiti Site Manager dashboard showing several managed network sites with live status and uptime graphs"
      />
      <figcaption>
        Every site I look after on one dashboard — gateways, switches, access points, and cameras,
        with live status and uptime at a glance.
      </figcaption>
    </figure>

    <figure class="shot">
      <img
        src="/images/unifi-controller.png"
        width="2843"
        height="636"
        loading="lazy"
        alt="UniFi controller device list showing a gateway, PoE switch, meshed access points, and cameras all online"
      />
      <figcaption>
        A typical install: wired backbone with PoE switching, meshed Wi-Fi in every room, and
        doorbell and outdoor cameras — all on a single controller.
      </figcaption>
    </figure>

    <ul class="includes">
      <li>Coverage planning &amp; professional placement</li>
      <li>Wired backbone &amp; PoE switching</li>
      <li>Meshed Wi-Fi across the whole space</li>
      <li>Ongoing monitoring, updates &amp; management</li>
    </ul>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .section-head {
    margin-bottom: 2.5rem;
  }

  .shot {
    margin: 0 0 2rem;
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: var(--radius);
    overflow: hidden;
    background: var(--bg-elevated);
  }

  .shot img {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    height: auto;
  }

  .shot figcaption {
    padding: 1rem 1.25rem;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    font-size: 0.92rem;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
  }

  .includes {
    list-style: none;
    margin: 2.5rem 0 0;
    padding: 0;
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr));
    gap: 0.75rem;
  }

  .includes li {
    position: relative;
    padding: 0.85rem 1rem 0.85rem 2.1rem;
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: var(--radius-sm);
    background: var(--surface);
    color: var(--text-muted);
    font-size: 0.95rem;
  }

  .includes li::before {
    content: '›';
    position: absolute;
    left: 1rem;
    color: var(--accent);
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
  }
</style>
